WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.880
 While we hope that you have a seamless 
  RStudio Cloud experience, 

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.680
 occasionally things 
  might not work as intended. 

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.680
 Sometimes when we're working on a project, 
  it may fail to load 

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.000
 or become unresponsive. When this happens 

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:20.000
 we can relaunch the project by clicking on 
  the three dots inside a circle 

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.120
 to the left of the settings 
  icon at the top of our project. 

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.400
 Choosing the third option from this menu 
  will relaunch our project. 

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.080
 If this doesn't solve your issue, 
  you can check to see 

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.000
 if there are any broader issues 
  with RStudio Cloud. 

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.120
 To do this, expand the menu on the left 

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.880
 to expose the current system 
  status option in the help menu. 

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.240
 Clicking this will tell us if RStudio 
  Cloud is running as intended. 

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:51.800
 If RStudio Cloud is operational 
  and you are still running into issues, 

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:56.280
 you may choose to post on our community 
  forum or reach out to our RStudio 

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.520
 Technical Support team. 

